    "detailed_description": "About Arcanion: Rise of Magi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArcanion is a story about a young girl named Magi. Who is starting out at becoming a Warrior of Arcanion, a group who's duty is to defend their abbey and home from any invaders! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, after Magi's first routine mission, one of the abbey's recently acquired treasures, the Dark Tome is stolen by a mysterious hooded man, who vows to get revenge on the Warriors of Arcanion, and also seems to share a familiar bond with Magi. Who is this man? And how does he know Magi? And what secrets does their home possess? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Levels that can be played in any order you wish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Obtain Aura Powers and Equipment to boost your abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-10 Playable levels. (The demo only has 3 playable levels.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZ ..... JUMP<br />\r\nC ..... SHOOT<br />\r\nX ..... SIDE<br />\r\nLEFT, RIGHT ARROW ..... MOVE LEFT AND RIGHT<br />\r\nUP AND DOWN ..... CLIMBING LADDERS<br />\r\n0 ..... MENU<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-CONTROLLER- (These controls will be based on a SNES Controller)<br />\r\nB ..... JUMP<br />\r\nY ..... SHOOT<br />\r\nX ..... SIDE<br />\r\nLEFT and RIGHT ..... MOVE LEFT AND RIGHT<br />\r\nUP AND DOWN ..... CLIMBING LADDERS<br />\r\nSTART ..... MENU",
    "about_the_game": "About Arcanion: Rise of Magi.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nArcanion is a story about a young girl named Magi. Who is starting out at becoming a Warrior of Arcanion, a group who's duty is to defend their abbey and home from any invaders! <br />\r\n<br />\r\nHowever, after Magi's first routine mission, one of the abbey's recently acquired treasures, the Dark Tome is stolen by a mysterious hooded man, who vows to get revenge on the Warriors of Arcanion, and also seems to share a familiar bond with Magi. Who is this man? And how does he know Magi? And what secrets does their home possess? <br />\r\n<br />\r\nFeatures:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Levels that can be played in any order you wish.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-Obtain Aura Powers and Equipment to boost your abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-10 Playable levels. (The demo only has 3 playable levels.)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nControls:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nZ ..... JUMP<br />\r\nC ..... SHOOT<br />\r\nX ..... SIDE<br />\r\nLEFT, RIGHT ARROW ..... MOVE LEFT AND RIGHT<br />\r\nUP AND DOWN ..... CLIMBING LADDERS<br />\r\n0 ..... MENU<br />\r\n<br />\r\n-CONTROLLER- (These controls will be based on a SNES Controller)<br />\r\nB ..... JUMP<br />\r\nY ..... SHOOT<br />\r\nX ..... SIDE<br />\r\nLEFT and RIGHT ..... MOVE LEFT AND RIGHT<br />\r\nUP AND DOWN ..... CLIMBING LADDERS<br />\r\nSTART ..... MENU",
    "short_description": "Arcanion: Tale of Magi is a retro-style platformer that tells the story of a fledgling warrior Magi, and she and her allies must recover a book from a thief who seeks to use its powers to carry out his revenge.",
